@HostAddress = http://localhost:5030
@Token = YOUR_JWT_HERE

### HR dashboard
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/hr/dashboard
Accept: application/json

###

### Applicants of job 1 (filter + search)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/hr/jobs/1/applicants?status=all
Accept: application/json

###

### Shortlisted candidates (schedule dropdown)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/hr/applications?status=Shortlisted
Accept: application/json

###

### Application details
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/hr/applications/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Change status (needs HR/Admin token)
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/hr/applications/2/status
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "shortlist",
  "note": "Strong CV."
}

###

### Download CV
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/hr/applications/1/cv
Accept: application/pdf

###

### Upcoming interviews
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/hr/interviews?tab=upcoming
Accept: application/json

###

### Schedule interview (needs HR/Admin token)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/hr/interviews
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicationId": 1,
  "type": "Technical",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-10-20T10:00:00Z",
  "location": "Online - Teams"
}

###

### Record interview result (needs HR/Admin token)
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/hr/interviews/1/result
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "result": "Passed",
  "notes": "Great system design."
}

###
# =======================================================================
# AI: CV -> job recommendations (OpenRouter + Gemma)
# =======================================================================

### Login as a test candidate (created during the AI testing session).
# If this account doesn't exist yet, register it first via POST /api/Auth/Register.
# @name login
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ai.test.candidate@mail.com",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

###
### Jobs recommended for the logged-in candidate by the AI
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Candidate/recommended-jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.value.accessToken}}

###
### AI summary of the candidate's CV (extracted skills, years, bio)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Candidate/cv-analysis
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.value.accessToken}}

###
### Force regeneration (after profile edits, or when the AI was rate-limited)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Candidate/recommended-jobs/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.value.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
